{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1338,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68814ece233b1009ad4c0526",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b33a254fab11bd5c13f77a29969e0a73f385063bb77b92a7f940b8106c726ed7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8521ad2fd7558c8b99a0d46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "12a3d75820fc4414b98f3d27daf9918f1ed7624f3f238be344ff606794b30ba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:175751d37cf5542e810edfb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1643897c1281a008e1e5b8013f3e41faa4f89bde5f39ea177e3fff9b449c0c83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1b1449b2e4f8835ff7357b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天好像能拿到这个喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8431449e67383ca154ede63415b979aa827a631eb0e2efb844f9149e581cdfe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4db878117a3c7faff15d703c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～好──没劲……\r\n现在可以一秒就睡着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fbe498921cfa18fd6b5301e6766fb792b517398a490162d33f7d61dafcb6d1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08d2f5dc4d7b79bc913bf735",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天啊，好懒得动……\r\n今天干脆也休息吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "df858d05243444169f7721ede3acc6359926563782e4bf8180ff2602ff61a45e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef9e48a490f8d10f276f90d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉很不错～☆\r\n今天的主角\r\n绝对就是我了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10efc405b194f15d24f54ba9a32f973b0fa9178c753a1b05a6ca39cf30a84d76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd8817223079a3e889930a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊──让人忍不住了！\r\n超想疯狂跑一场的～！\r\n快点快点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8ee0935a1a49749d991f0404c3c6ebafbc11a679e46ca8c8fe521f99e424065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96f25ec7f718df1a83a88be1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦～啦……唔，天啊。\r\n自己竟然会开心哼歌，超搞笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d22dce5b08da400816bd3a101723cabeaa53661fd5a7a8d44bf76f53109f3e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8a18755922973b8a0a5d402",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得……脚好像很轻盈？\r\n好──\r\n要做什么训练尽管说吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f875e4bc63094a8dda569c896ae14a29083bb6461ffdde3f04064c5f132d2c52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87fb3bcde50e3d38fadee4b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然也不是没有干劲，\r\n但也说不上有吧。\r\n总之，一切都随便咯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa80d44ce4db46a99af333e6ca78488e4fe761d6a925ab208088af0b292f2986",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f48040854e90c4a5d4508ef0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也多指教了。\r\n总之，悠哉地开始吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "784250a59b7a704769d51ee961b19ee5292296215e6b852eac20c6cf60b15cb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b379c2df47a58ff0148b4d2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "指甲……\r\n颜色好像不怎么样啊。\r\n啊──好想现在就换个颜色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a5fea2771df3672f6cdc36ce092271233883c2c6e867795ef101dc21399fe9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5df362d99527c6831c6df8e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该说是懒\r\n还是什么呢？\r\n就是没什么干劲啊──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bed0bee0562f96b7465dc7c9451866381403984d22ddf22d695d8f5011edb046",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:505156553e82644b0fe60710",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚上的指甲油剥落了。\r\n有够糟的……\r\n真的无法努力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95427bb299fab4a8d252dffc8a51b049a379c82cc5389ae9c1e58edf4c13a248",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f16d1c5f7bb1297f5fb2801",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上手滑了一下，\r\n把亮片撒了满地……\r\n唉……没有干劲了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "75b854a30cfdff8007401ab2a3ef5ceb98efd3c79be669f9c8e38e5c0140f80a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1490907417779e891bc797d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有休息也太虐了吧。\r\n让人超没劲的～\r\n这样根本赢不了比赛吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d07a468390b104ab4186159322b9a03d4416d619ab59bc4b4e0efb723c55ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9096f49db0b66468bb1a94ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你是认真的吗？\r\n这种强人所难的玩法，\r\n请直接跳过谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "682a095dfbc8812dcfa39a19a8900c6e255260639f7818ba176e32a6876fa748",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ffccbd686438d62f6848ea6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是配合竞赛\r\n一直非常认真练习！\r\n完全不可能会输的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "837d3eef18488bba95a110046ba8f27d8ee4f31a4784355e71a85c32ed06dc77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3302197fa1b6238e6f712330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该说是不觉得会输，\r\n或是想要大展身手吗？天啊，\r\n好不像我会说的话，也太搞笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70166297ab9410404eb6cc9e755ed9a89804047192f70cfff6438d583af73d58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d37e7a92cc1fd4054f3572",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢呼声好夸张喔，真搞笑。\r\n不过，倒是不会让你们失望喔。\r\n我立刻就过去，再等一下啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e1f97d2067b02e530123fdd93ba42d34310a1744bbdf8d2805bc4617d10e5e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:499f4c80d7bda91c295f0700",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经做好获胜的准备，\r\n算是随时都可以上场吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afcd091abac53483e6f0f5a7d6a3135ddffa9a5294b952f9d705446b5ce2e20e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6ec55ddc9c6a5bc2f7019c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "指甲和彩妆都状态绝佳。\r\n受到注目也不会有问题，\r\n你就放心看着吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "37fdea0527740d05d30ab39b88fb1517dd340532951813aa7e8f20bdd1dccde2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c4ba78a34228cb8e739bfbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天有作战计划吗？\r\n尽管吩咐吧，\r\n一切交给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ba43430c1999bf709f8b3ce01ebd40b6448e6782bcb190e869ca3f3de67cfb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03153bbf91eb51550805c2e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之就慢慢努力吧。\r\n只要像平常那样\r\n奔跑就可以了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03483bea7ab9cfb64070c1074f9a52006d3e560f851ea6dff9cc328d0dfc072e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb702c6d9c46a1d4add1187d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上传非常多\r\n到Umatok了～☆\r\n接下来就获胜后见咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25d76ba1166a282fb40c969d2cde1e9d6e0c15bb21d5c5161bdc7d63a502aadc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebfea6521795cc2bbd827f14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才早餐吃了汉堡。\r\n超好吃的。有摄取营养，\r\n绝对没问题了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac2b6f64af8e37b73e546561e135147218d3c4bf536488d734a757c45c40f508",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa7ec5f2a0e304e83d93b7e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……\r\n总觉得有点不上不下……\r\n总之，还是会加油啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7f68b5ca72434470bb32018682624131a4354b4da689218325900671296ebcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c957a2666219b40c44b443ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有点提不起劲，\r\n但还是会尽量做好。\r\n不需要担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5b63f6fa1b6022977b982fc3c6b2a908d28d4cec17845959f580fe6ed8ab764",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cc9a8c81a405f68c7b7f459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在只要\r\n尽我所能就可以了吧。\r\n……总会有办法的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0329ba9517152d9b1460c2d210819835ab14a0b78047ec79472a17c6de07c4c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d25889431812bbe0ab5c926",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊──好没劲……脚感觉很沉重。\r\n……但也不会因为这样就放弃啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "958ee2b72d030d6b22cad0e199be685d421a390f1b2d6542bd4b95db3924dd20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aec59d1151f95cea5a6d6832",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实在是糟到极点。\r\n指甲油有点剥落。\r\n只能在竞赛发泄这股怒气了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "583b1daa937a0c4d469f7a647ee7ef27a1bb4794969111653548d596eef95215",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eccc8c5769ef408851c7b8bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "周遭的气势未免太吓人了吧？\r\n好热血……大家都很认真嘛。\r\n不过，我也不会输喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c6e0fa4f60d6db25e7e3be5ea05526bfbfa70f10316a32cfca48f4251fde9b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb616c00989f2fa8d133fd90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5139787f2e32a0c3d7fb860b9b8d5ef746735adedecf6745fa0f844482a2a5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77a68c6f54906f3bee1ea2d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场吧──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b92c8305edc24acaaae5574cebf6d14a9e3c659584a28ab3f01e9868e30b3676",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68169bf486b33bd4d00cc32c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多指教了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c82b8c25a3d265188f13eb5fc08e69f4eefc0ab1e6eeec6db86d13e13d6227f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6453dab9fc65abcbdee536f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去做就行了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b5767573db8d8fc40639eb91e21e51cca3cf302b76f5c98d5db079b92d7d6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2447ada258223ce0e4570d17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有够糟的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b88ace4b0932f710e65083c3fc9e63bbadcd9bb8a0f5977490cc5d2317baac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b47cbdd52e0cfa9809d7132a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这哪受得了啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "08234e35d38872a079d28fd3ab7eceaa81b57a690239fa49567c6325bc9fb090",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3db033da01c7a9fb8683649",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3df75138e8f66392aca57792906e5c011e14b71ba5321922be93e1d657c064a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c167bf58a299c4bfaf8f725e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了，是海耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a86c3f567c84157a2d491ec3637425e82cdf2224b4d53db1ca385380256dd97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb6215a19566ace27d4c874f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……谢谢，我可是很感谢你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cfb023d5a078a0160cbc05061d87d6ea8d24b8dcf79a35fdff9190d78e3a597",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d7874e95a95a822b82a127f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢啦，辛苦咯☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fef3053c369e33699e5b80522ca50daaaf3eddc121f27acada39f6f417765fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b2f05f8981643aaf63eb0fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔认真一下也没关系吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02cecd8e42d30ab5c59cedef85a4c442918211ecd9848af473383791a53b9cc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13235b8f6a51311b0ddd381e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
